| hkprocessFrameInput override | remote = g_usedRemoteInput → mHeld overridden | remote = g_usedRemoteInput → mHeld overridden (same final value) |
| Final mHeld | g_usedRemoteInput ✓ | g_usedRemoteInput ✓ |
